-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §53 חוזים אישיים (תמריצים): changing §21 of
-- the collective agreement of 31.8.94 (imported), from תשע"ב up to 1,500
-- teaching employees a school year may be employed under a special
-- personal contract (incentives), by the Ministry's approvals and
-- guidelines, in the areas §21 names; the agreed text of the contract is
-- annex ו'; and by 31.12 of every school year the employers send the
-- organisation, through the Ministry, the list of the teachers so employed
-- that year.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-v`
IMPORT `1994-08-31_oz-latmura_wage-supplements-1994`

§ `53 חוזים אישיים (תמריצים)`

DECLARE `Oz section 53 action` IS ONE OF
    `send the organisation the list of teachers on a special personal contract`

-- ¶1: "בשינוי לאמור בסעיף 21 להסכם הקיבוצי מיום 31.8.94" — §21
-- (imported) let the employers employ 100 teaching employees on special
-- contracts in תשנ"ה and 100 more in תשנ"ו, in the four kinds of area it
-- lists, on a uniform text, with the names sent at the end of each year.
-- §53 changes the number ((א)), the text ((ב)) and the list ((ג)); what it
-- leaves standing of §21 is where the arrangement runs: the confrontation
-- line, national priority area א', targeted treatment and the
-- rehabilitation neighbourhoods. (The agreement of 8.9.98, §11, kept §21
-- "בהסכם הנוכחי (1998)", for its own period, with more localities; §53
-- changes §21 as the agreement of 31.8.94 prints it: convention
-- reading.as-printed.)
@ref akn:art_53/p1
GIVEN a IS AN `area of the 1994 Oz special contracts`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `what section 21 leaves standing allows a special contract in` a IF
    `§21 of the 1994 Oz agreement runs in` a

§§ `53(א)`

-- (א): from the school year תשע"ב on (convention dates.school-year), up to
-- 1,500 teaching employees in every school year may be employed under a
-- special personal contract (incentives), by the Ministry of Education's
-- approvals and guidelines. "עד 1500" is the most the clause allows, so
-- 1,500 is in (an exception to convention thresholds.until).
@ref akn:art_53__para_a
`the most section 53 allows on special personal contracts in a school year` MEANS 1500

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      `teaching employees on such contracts in the year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within section 53's number in` y `teaching employees on such contracts in the year` IF
        y AT LEAST `the school year 5772`
    AND `teaching employees on such contracts in the year` AT MOST `the most section 53 allows on special personal contracts in a school year`

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      `teaching employees on such contracts in the year, him among them` IS A NUMBER
      `approved by the Ministry under its guidelines` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the area he teaches in` IS AN `area of the 1994 Oz special contracts` @desc as §21 of the agreement of 31.8.94 tells areas apart
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be employed on a special personal contract in` y `teaching employees on such contracts in the year, him among them` `approved by the Ministry under its guidelines` `the area he teaches in` IF
        `within section 53's number in` y `teaching employees on such contracts in the year, him among them`
    AND `approved by the Ministry under its guidelines`
    AND `what section 21 leaves standing allows a special contract in` `the area he teaches in`

§§ `53(ב)`

-- (ב): the agreed text of such a contract is annexed as annex ו'
-- (oz-founding-annex-v): a contract on its text is its particulars, for
-- one school year, and the special reward it pays.
@ref akn:art_53__para_b
GIVEN c IS AN `Oz special personal contract`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the school year a special personal contract is for` c IS
    c's `the school year it is for`

§§ `53(ג)`

-- (ג): by 31.12 of every school year (the day included: convention
-- dates.end) the employers send the organisation, through the Ministry of
-- Education, a list of the teachers whose employment under such a
-- contract was approved that school year. A school year y opens on 1.9.y,
-- so its 31.12 is in the same calendar year: the time runs from the
-- year's first day.
@ref akn:art_53__para_c
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `days from the opening of school year to its 31 December` y IS
    DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 y) MINUS DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 y)

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `Oz section 53 action`
DECIDE `sending the list of teachers on special personal contracts for` y IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `send the organisation the list of teachers on a special personal contract`
    WITHIN `days from the opening of school year to its 31 December` y
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "§53(ג): the list of the year's teachers on special personal contracts is sent by 31.12 of the school year"

§§ `53 -- illustrations`

#ASSERT `within section 53's number in` `the school year 5772` 1500
#ASSERT NOT `within section 53's number in` `the school year 5772` 1501
#ASSERT NOT `within section 53's number in` 2010 100
#ASSERT `may be employed on a special personal contract in` `the school year 5773` 1200 TRUE `a confrontation-line locality`
#ASSERT NOT `may be employed on a special personal contract in` `the school year 5773` 1200 FALSE `a confrontation-line locality`
#ASSERT NOT `may be employed on a special personal contract in` `the school year 5773` 1200 TRUE `another place`
-- §21's 100 of תשנ"ה against §53's 1,500
#ASSERT `the most section 53 allows on special personal contracts in a school year` MINUS `the special contracts §21 of the 1994 Oz agreement allows in` 1994 EQUALS 1400
#ASSERT `days from the opening of school year to its 31 December` 2011 EQUALS 121
#ASSERT `the school year a special personal contract is for` `a contract for 5772` EQUALS `the school year 5772`
